{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CfQ8me2DL83oJRHUqcezX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've drafted the acceptance contract for work item 20260908T113155. The contract is grounded in the supplied request, plan, and Definition Pack, and captures:\n\n- **Deterministic criteria** all naming the `k-12Harness` scope id with the manifest verification command plus focused per-module runs, each with mechanically checkable `expect` blocks.\n- **Required outputs** as the executor's permitted file set (the primary `evals/live.py`, `evals/graders.py`, contingent `evals/schema.py`/`evals/replay.py`, and the two test files), with `permitted_files` for the harness stage entry points that may only receive thin helpers and the append-only `work-store` evidence path.\n- **Preserved compatibility and failure semantics** lifted verbatim in intent from ADR-007/009/013/014/016/018/019 and the pinned contract (ADR-008).\n- **Contract requirements** recording the conflicts and gaps the plan surfaced (inert `--stage` vs request premise, undefined isolation/oracle semantics, provider-authority ambiguity, RunRecord shape constraint, and the unstated diff-allowlist) rather than silently resolving them.\n- **Out-of-scope** items covering the pinned contract, production decision logic, stub-tier rules, the existing flag surface, and the server layer."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7036,"cache_read_input_tokens":86391,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7036},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"415a5447-a71d-46ec-9b66-a0da4e7242f9","uuid":"b0f70dd5-a462-47b5-87e2-8ca08f329b70","request_id":"req_011CfQ8mdSzByJEPrJakJnfJ"}
